WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Look at the word BLUE. The ink is another color.
Which answer jumps out first?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1935, Stroop measured that tiny argument
between a practiced habit and a new instruction.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Years later, researchers found that targeted suggestion
sometimes changed the interference for carefully selected people.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The remarkable part is not proof of a magic recording;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
it is how much a precise question can reveal.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
